/v1/","context":{"app_id":1704950,"app_scope":"base","country":"KR","language":"koreana","batch_size":100,"review_scope":"store_summary_filtered","percentage_precision":"source_rounded_integer","review_score_label":"사용자 평가 없음"},"error_code":"no_reviews"}],"events":[{"id":"steam-steam-1704950-1846651706692145","game_id":"steam-1704950","kind":"announcement","title":"Next Fest begins — BATEYD demo is in it","summary":"Steam Next Fest starts today at 10:00 Pacific and runs through Monday, October 26.The BATEYD demo is part of it.What’s in it: the opening session with your psychiatrist — where you pick your cat and decide how your deaths will be depicted — and the first two of the five nightmares.Everything in those nightmares runs on rules. The Beast chases when it sees you. Sentinels fire fireworks on sight, and fireworks always draw the Beast. A hungry Beast eats a steak before it hunts a cat. None of it cha","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-19T18:25:20Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706692145","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:01:15Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-1704950-1846018067941198","game_id":"steam-1704950","kind":"announcement","title":"New Trailer: The Rules","summary":"The new BATEYD trailer is up, at the top of the store page.It opens with the Beast eating cats, which is what happens when you don’t know the rules. Then it goes through four of them, one at a time:The Beast prefers Steak.Fireworks always draw the Beast.Make noise, be seen: the Beast chases you.Get catnip, and cats follow you.There are more. The loading screens teach some of them; the nightmares teach the rest. None of them change halfway through, and none of them cheat. Learn enough, and the Be","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-12T14:49:09Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846018067941198","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:01:15Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-1704950-1845383656394595","game_id":"steam-1704950","kind":"announcement","title":"BATEYD Demo Out Now","summary":"The BATEYD demo is live on the store page. What's in it: the opening session with your psychiatrist — the tutorial lives inside that conversation — and the first two of the game's five nightmares.A few things worth knowing before you go in. This is a game about planning, not reflexes. Everything follows rules — the Beast, its Sentinels, the fireworks, the hunger. Nothing is random, and nothing cheats. Mushrooms let you rise above a nightmare and study it at your own pace. And don't be afraid to ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-05T20:42:24Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1845383656394595","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:01:15Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-1704950-1845383656387299","game_id":"steam-1704950","kind":"announcement","title":"BATEYD on Steam Deck: what to expect","summary":"BATEYD plays very well on Steam Deck, with full controller support and no on-screen keyboard ever needed. Before you start, a couple of notes on graphics settings will make it play even better. First launch on Steam DeckThe first time you launch the game on Steam Deck, it automatically sets Graphics Quality to Low. That is what guarantees a steady frame rate across the whole game. That said, the game looks much better at Medium and still runs smoothly there, so I encourage you to switch: pause t","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-02T18:12:18Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1845383656387299","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:01:15Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-1704950-1839676055897390","game_id":"steam-1704950","kind":"announcement","title":"The teaser is live","summary":"The teaser for The Beast Awoke to Eat Your Darlings is live — top of the store page, above the screenshots.Thirty seconds, all of it in-engine. It opens the way most runs do — with the Beast catching you — and shows what happens next: the game offers help, you turn it down, and the run that follows outsmarts the Beast instead of outrunning it, all the way to the elevator, the cats, and a score screen that pays you for the help you refused. The music and every sound in it come straight from the g","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-04T13:32:01Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1839676055897390","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:01:15Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-1704950-1839676055881093","game_id":"steam-1704950","kind":"announcement","title":"The Beast is nearly done. New screenshots, and what happens next.","summary":"BATEYD — The Beast Awoke to Eat Your Darlings — is nearly finished.If you’re just arriving: it’s a horror game you outsmart, not survive. Everything in its nightmares runs on rules you can learn. Sentinels fire a flare when they see you. A flare always brings the Beast. A hungry Beast eats a steak before it hunts a cat. Pet a Sentinel from behind and it melts into a puddle of beer, which is a trap, because the Beast doesn’t look where it’s running. None of this changes between attempts. That’s t","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-07-28T23:02:32Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1839676055881093","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:01:15Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-1704950-1833968530893831","game_id":"steam-1704950","kind":"announcement","title":"Early Build Playtest","summary":"Today I'm going through a full playthrough! The biggest change from last time is an optimization pass, with proper graphics settings that adapts to your machine and a game that looks nice regardless of settings. It now runs at a decent framerate on a RTX 1060, and possibly on lower specs too (this playthrough is happening on a RTX 3060 laptop).The scoring screen and system has been completely overhauled, and that's also a reason for the whole playthrough -- need to start getting references to se","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-05-30T16:26:41Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1833968530893831","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:01:15Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-1704950-1832700592786823","game_id":"steam-1704950","kind":"announcement","title":"Early Build Playtest","summary":"When you get catnip, cats follow you -- which is paramount as you need to save them! However, \"cats following you\" is fun only as long as you can see them. I made some changes that make this possible, from a camera that automatically gets farther away the more cats are following you, and with a cat following behavior that's more likely to get the cats on screen rather than just behind you.","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-05-13T15:56:21Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1832700592786823","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:01:15Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-1704950-1832065502813452","game_id":"steam-1704950","kind":"announcement","title":"Early Build Playtest","summary":"As the game gets closer to its release date (should definitely be by the end of this year!), I'm streaming my playtests, so you can get a better idea of what it is about. Feel free to chime in, comments and suggestions are welcome!","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-05-07T21:42:33Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1832065502813452","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:01:15Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-1704950-1831432155581424","game_id":"steam-1704950","kind":"announcement","title":"Early Build Playtest","summary":"As the game gets closer to its release date (should definitely be by the end of this year!), I'm streaming my playtests, so you can get a better idea of what it is about. Feel free to chime in, comments and suggestions are welcome!","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-05-05T21:26:38Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1831432155581424","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:01:15Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-1704950":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-25T23:59:04Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-25T23:59:03Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-1704950":"2026-10-25T23:59:04Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":{"1704950":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-25T23:59:03Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-25T23:59:03Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[]},"5309910":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-25T23:59:04Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-25T23:59:04Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[]}},"context_snapshots":[{"schema_version":1,"game_id":"steam-1704950","app_id":1704950,"app_scope":"base","observed_at":"2026-10-26T06:14:06Z","source_url":"https://api.steampowered.com/IStoreBrowseService/GetItems/v1/","context":{"country":"KR","language":"koreana","batch_size":100},"status":"ok","error_code":null,"store_item_success":1,"raw_item